==History==
2024
*The Goblin Demolisher card was added to the game on 17/6/2024, in the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]].
*On 2/7/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Demolisher’s death damage radius to 2.5 tiles (from 3 tiles), his death damage by 13.1%, and his attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds).
*On 8/10/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/10/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Demolisher’s lifetime to 7 seconds (from 10 seconds).
*On 30/10/2024, the [[Version History#Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update (30/10/2024)|Removal of Goblin Queen's Journey Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Goblin Demolisher from Goblin Mines to Spooky Town.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Demolisher’s lifetime to 8 seconds (from 7 seconds).
*On 3/6/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/6/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Demolisher’s lifetime to 10 seconds (from 8 seconds).
*On 1/12/2025, a balance update increased the Goblin Demolisher's attack speed to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds)

